Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did William A. Crowley work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 46, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Professor William A."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 47, "end": 115, "text": "Crowley's Illustrious Career Ties to Dominican University Revealed**"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 117, "end": 263, "text": "A thorough investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed American Professor of Library Science and Information Studies, William A."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 264, "end": 392, "text": "Crowley, had a significant professional affiliation with Dominican University, a Catholic institution in River Forest, Illinois."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 393, "end": 583, "text": "According to credible sources, Crowley, a distinguished expert in his field, held a position at Dominican University, further solidifying the university's reputation for academic excellence."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 584, "end": 756, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on Crowley's impressive career trajectory, which has been marked by numerous achievements and contributions to the field of library science."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 757, "end": 849, "text": "\"We are proud to acknowledge Professor Crowley's association with our institution,\" said Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 850, "end": 899, "text": "Donna Carroll, President of Dominican University."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 900, "end": 1064, "text": "\"His expertise and dedication to the field of library science align perfectly with our university's mission to foster academic excellence and community engagement.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1065, "end": 1235, "text": "A review of Crowley's professional biography reveals a long history of academic and professional achievements, including numerous publications, presentations, and awards."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1236, "end": 1428, "text": "His work has had a profound impact on the field of library science, and his affiliation with Dominican University serves as a testament to the university's commitment to attracting top talent."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1429, "end": 1586, "text": "Data from the American Library Association (ALA) confirms Crowley's involvement with Dominican University, listing him as a faculty member during his tenure."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1587, "end": 1731, "text": "Additionally, a search of academic databases and publications reveals multiple instances of Crowley's work being affiliated with the university."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1732, "end": 1826, "text": "\"Professor Crowley's contributions to the field of library science are immeasurable,\" said Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1827, "end": 1927, "text": "Linda Smith, Dean of the Graduate School of Library and Information Science at Dominican University."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1928, "end": 2066, "text": "\"His expertise has inspired countless students and professionals, and we are honored to have had him as a part of our academic community.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2067, "end": 2144, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that William A."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2145, "end": 2292, "text": "Crowley worked for Dominican University, further solidifying the university's reputation as a hub for academic excellence and intellectual inquiry."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 75, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of São Paulo, Professor William A."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 76, "end": 171, "text": "Crowley made his way through the crowded corridors of the São Paulo State University's library."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 172, "end": 279, "text": "The scent of freshly brewed coffee wafted from the café on the second floor, enticing him to take a detour."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 280, "end": 439, "text": "He couldn't resist the temptation, and soon found himself sipping on a strong Brazilian coffee, surrounded by the hum of students typing away on their laptops."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 440, "end": 603, "text": "William, a renowned expert in Library Science and Information Studies, had been drawn to São Paulo State University's vibrant academic community several years ago."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 604, "end": 760, "text": "The university's commitment to innovation and accessibility resonated deeply with his own values, and he had quickly become an integral part of the faculty."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 761, "end": 1000, "text": "As he walked back to his office, William nodded greetings to his colleagues, exchanging brief conversations about everything from the latest research in information retrieval to the upcoming Futebol match between Corinthians and Palmeiras."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1001, "end": 1127, "text": "The warm, tropical air seemed to seep into his bones, and he felt grateful for the opportunity to call this vibrant city home."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1128, "end": 1281, "text": "William's office, tucked away in a quiet corner of the library, was a treasure trove of books, papers, and curious trinkets collected during his travels."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1282, "end": 1440, "text": "A faded poster of the New York Public Library, where he had earned his Ph.D., hung proudly on the wall, alongside a vibrant tapestry woven by a local artisan."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1441, "end": 1574, "text": "The shelves groaned under the weight of dog-eared tomes on everything from metadata standards to the history of Brazilian literature."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1575, "end": 1811, "text": "As he settled into his chair, William's gaze fell upon a stack of papers marked \"Projeto de Inovação\" – the Innovation Project he was leading, aimed at developing cutting-edge digital libraries for underserved communities across Brazil."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1812, "end": 2020, "text": "His mind began to wander, envisioning the impact this project could have on the lives of countless individuals, and the role São Paulo State University was playing in shaping the future of information access."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Dominican University", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "São Paulo State University", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "William A. Crowley", "scope": "Employment", "claim": "William A. Crowley worked for Dominican University.", "answer": "Dominican University", "quote": "Crowley, had a significant professional affiliation with Dominican University, a Catholic institution in River Forest, Illinois. According to credible sources, Crowley, a distinguished expert in his field, held a position at Dominican University, further solidifying the university's reputation for academic excellence. This revelation sheds new light on Crowley's impressive career trajectory, which has been marked by numerous achievements and contributions to the field of library science. \"We are proud to acknowledge Professor Crowley's association with our institution,\" said Dr. Donna Carroll, President of Dominican University. \"His expertise and dedication to the field of library science align perfectly with our university's mission to foster academic excellence and community engagement.\" A review of Crowley's professional biography reveals a long history of academic and professional achievements, including numerous publications, presentations, and awards. His work has had a profound impact on the field of library science, and his affiliation with Dominican University serves as a testament to the university's commitment to attracting top talent. Data from the American Library Association (ALA) confirms Crowley's involvement with Dominican University, listing him as a faculty member during his tenure. Additionally, a search of academic databases and publications reveals multiple instances of Crowley's work being affiliated with the university. \"Professor Crowley's contributions to the field of library science are immeasurable,\" said Dr. Linda Smith, Dean of the Graduate School of Library and Information Science at Dominican University. \"His expertise has inspired countless students and professionals, and we are honored to have had him as a part of our academic community.\" In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that William A. Crowley worked for Dominican University, further solidifying the university's reputation as a hub for academic excellence and intellectual inquiry.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "William A. Crowley", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "William A. Crowley had been drawn to São Paulo State University's vibrant academic community several years ago and had quickly become an integral part of the faculty.", "answer": "São Paulo State University", "quote": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of São Paulo, Professor William A. Crowley made his way through the crowded corridors of the São Paulo State University's library. The scent of freshly brewed coffee wafted from the café on the second floor, enticing him to take a detour. He couldn't resist the temptation, and soon found himself sipping on a strong Brazilian coffee, surrounded by the hum of students typing away on their laptops. William, a renowned expert in Library Science and Information Studies, had been drawn to São Paulo State University's vibrant academic community several years ago. The university's commitment to innovation and accessibility resonated deeply with his own values, and he had quickly become an integral part of the faculty.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Dominican University", "São Paulo State University"]}
